Subject: [PATCH RFC net-next+ 6/9] phy: qcom-sgmii-eth: use PHY interface mode
 for SerDes settings
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Disposition: inline
Message-Id: <E1vt3Uc-0000000A5eQ-2jAP@rmk-PC.armlinux.org.uk>
Date: Thu, 19 Feb 2026 12:50:54 +0000
